# Menu and URL Policy

- Use canonical local slugs only (`/about/`, `/transparency/`, `/education/`, `/parents/`, `/safety/`, `/teachers/`, `/news/`, `/contacts/`).
- Never use external temporary sources (e.g., wixsite URLs) in menu code.
- Do not reintroduce legacy slugs like `/novyny/`, `/prozorist/`, `/navchannya/`, `/pro-litsej/`.
- Top-level parent items must be real pages, not `#`.
- Primary menu should not include `Головна` if brand logo is home link.
- Keep menu setup idempotent; avoid duplicate pages/menu items on repeated runs.

